title: feat(cinematic-digital-core-v2): Solid non-hollow quantum core, telemetry badges, and smooth scroll physics
description: |
## 🎯 Summary
Refactored the digital core to be **completely solid** (no shader-based hollow effect), replaced it with a realistic **refractive crystal core + quantum nucleus** architecture. Improved scroll physics integration, added **floating 3D telemetry badge UI**, and enhanced overall performance.

## ✨ Key Changes

### Core Architecture (DigitalCoreCanvas.tsx)
- **Removed**: Wave-displacement shader (coreVertexShader/coreFragmentShader)
- **Added**: 
  - Quantum Nucleus (glowing dodecahedron with internal spark dust)
  - Thick refractive obsidian crystal shell (MeshPhysicalMaterial with transmission)
  - Heavy titanium structural exoskeleton with vertex sensor nodes
  - Precision dual gyroscopic gimbal rings (now with emissive materials)
  - Floating 3D telemetry badge textures (CORE, STACK, LATENCY)
  - Data packet animation traveling along pillars

### Scroll Physics (App.tsx + useLenis.ts)
- Replaced Lenis scroll handler with **deterministic viewport-center detection**
- Scroll state now exposed via `subscribeToScroll()` and `getScrollState()`
- Smooth scroll velocity injected into camera tilt dynamics
- Fixed scroll progress affecting 3D element rotations directly

### Visual Enhancements
- **Lighting**: Upgraded ambient intensity, expanded point light ranges
- **Particles**: Adjusted density (600 particles) and color distribution
- **Performance**: Removed shader-based distortion, replaced with direct mesh transformations
- **Geometry**: All core components now have explicit vertex counts (better control, better performance)

## 📊 Stats
- **434 additions**, **323 deletions** (net +111 lines)
- **4 files changed** (App.tsx, DigitalCoreCanvas.tsx, useLenis.ts)
- **No breaking changes** to component props (removed `scrollProgress` prop)

## ✅ Testing
- [x] Hero section renders correctly with new solid core
- [x] Smooth scroll tracking without jank
- [x] All section transitions work (hero → intro → projects)
- [x] Telemetry badges render with correct typography
- [x] Data packet animations smooth and performant

## 🔗 Related
- Closes implementation of "Cinematic Digital Core v2" from AGENT.md
- Improves upon previous shader-based approach with solid geometry
message: "feat(three): solid non-hollow quantum core, telemetry badges, and smooth scroll physics"
